        "faq1": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What does unisex perfume actually mean?",
            "answer": "A unisex fragrance is built without leaning masculine or feminine. Instead of the florals or aquatics that marketing tends to assign to one gender, it is composed around notes almost everyone reads as universal, such as oud, amber, musk, citrus and spice. That balance is what lets anyone wear it comfortably."
          }
        },
        "faq2": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Can a couple really share the same perfume?",
            "answer": "Yes, and many do. Because unisex scents avoid strongly gendered notes, the same bottle can smell natural on two different people, shifting slightly with each person's skin. Oud, amber and musk-based fragrances share particularly well."
          }
        },
        "faq3": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Why are so many Arabian perfumes unisex?",
            "answer": "Arabian perfumery was never divided by gender the way Western designer fragrance was. Oud, attar and bakhoor have always been worn by everyone, so many of the region's most treasured scents are naturally unisex, and they hold up well in the heat."
          }
        },
        "faq4": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Which unisex perfumes last the longest?",
            "answer": "Oud, amber and woody Eau de Parfums last longest, because their heavy base notes resist evaporation in warm weather. For maximum longevity, look for Eau de Parfum or Extrait concentrations, and check the longevity note on each product page."
          }
        },
        "faq5": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Are unisex perfumes a good gift?",
            "answer": "They are one of the safest gifts you can give, precisely because they are not tied to gender. A warm amber, a versatile oud or a clean citrus suits a wide range of tastes, and our gift sets come packaged ready for birthdays, Eid and special occasions."
          }
        },
