            "question": "Can I wear unisex fragrances all year round?",
            "answer": "Yes. Fresh and citrus unisex scents feel best in the warmer months, while oud, spice and amber come into their own on cooler evenings. Many people keep a lighter and a deeper option and switch between them with the season."
